{"id":"viste","lemma":"viste","pos":"intj","rank":539,"glosses":["you know; used as a space filler, usually in the middle of a sentence, or when telling a story"],"ipa":"/ˈbiste/","examples":[{"text":"¿Viste a un doctor?","en":"Did you see a doctor?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/453108"},{"text":"Dime lo que viste.","en":"Tell me what you saw.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/212784"},{"text":"Cuéntame lo que viste.","en":"Tell me what you saw.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/448257"},{"text":"¿Viste a mi mujer?","en":"Have you seen my wife?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/519662"},{"text":"¿A quién viste allí?","en":"Who did you meet there?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/73936"}]}